# Official THM API endpoints. The build AES/GCM-encrypts these into
# GeneratedApiEndpoints.java. The rest of the HTTP stack (APIUtils, TrustedHttp)
# is readable source. Remote JSON cannot change these endpoints or make the client
# fetch arbitrary URLs.
#
# These are the same public hosts shipped in official Leonn170709/THM-Addons jars.
# They are not credentials. Player API tokens stay in the Discord player panel.
# Override by copying this file to secrets.properties (gitignored).
#
# The local stats-cache key is generated at runtime and stored under
# meteor-client/thm/stats-key so encrypted stats survive rebuilds.
api.memberHud=https://api.highwaymen.cc/users
api.highway=https://api.highwaymen.cc/
api.status=https://api.highwaymen.cc/
api.highwayStatus=https://api.highwaymen.cc/status
api.cape=https://api.highwaymen.cc/cape/
api.capePost=https://api.highwaymen.cc/cape/
api.capeIndex=https://highwaymen.cc/cape/index
